sequenceDiagram
  actor H as Human
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as Anthropic API
  participant DB as Supabase
  participant R as Runner
  participant S as Sandbox agent

  rect rgb(240,240,240)
  note over H,DB: Phase 1 - human writes the plan
  H->>W: Write doc pages, draw on boards
  W->>DB: Autosave page JSON + assets
  H->>W: Highlight text or region, ask AI to refine / draw / advise
  W->>A: assist(selection, instruction) - streamed
  A-->>W: Proposal (text or shapes)
  H->>W: Accept or discard proposal
  end

  rect rgb(255,248,220)
  note over H,A: Phase 2 - AI compiles context
  H->>W: Compile context
  W->>DB: Load pages, assets, repo summary
  W->>W: Pages to Markdown + Mermaid + board PNGs
  W->>A: IR to spec (structured output)
  A-->>W: Spec v1 with source refs
  H->>W: Review, edit spec, split tasks
  W->>A: Spec to task DAG (structured output)
  A-->>W: Tasks with deps, files, acceptance checks
  end

  rect rgb(230,245,230)
  note over H,S: Phase 3 - agents build in parallel
  H->>W: Launch approved tasks
  W->>DB: Insert runs (status = queued)
  R->>DB: Claim queued run
  R->>S: Create sandbox, clone repo, start agent with task spec
  S-->>DB: Stream events (text, tool calls, PR link)
  DB-->>W: Realtime push to dashboard
  H->>W: Message an agent or edit the plan
  W->>A: Recompile to spec v2, diff v1 to v2
  W->>DB: Insert message / plan-update
  R->>S: Forward into running session
  end
